Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:13.92,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}那一天我們在蘋果樹下成為共犯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.42,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}嘗試越過邊界線
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:18.84,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}馬上就black out 「你果然生氣了」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:21.43,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}被趕到這個次元
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:22.80,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}我怎麼能這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.22,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}就憑我這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:26.26,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}怎麼可能是我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:27.81,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}把這歸為你的過錯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:28.93,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}我得到了秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:31.10,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}用無花果的葉子遮住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.31,0:03:33.65,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}很快就醒來了 (woo)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:36.02,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}卻墜入空中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:38.02,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}怎麼說呢  停不下來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.65,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}再咬一口  again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:41.82,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Falling, falling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:45.20,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}向摩天大樓螺旋墜落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:46.70,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}現在 falling falling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.91,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}只有兩個人  無人能夠發現
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:50.45,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}即使已經謝幕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.45,0:03:52.75,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}(Yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah) 在任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:56.17,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}(Yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah) 任由自己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:04:01.26,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}不知何時  傷口已經痊癒  yeah
